program	errors/copy_bound_missing.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	cannot call `.copy()` on a value of unbounded type parameter `T`
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: cannot call `.copy()` on a value of unbounded type parameter `T`"
log	"  --> examples/errors/copy_bound_missing.saw:7:6"
log	"    |"
log	" 7 |     x.copy()"
log	"    |      ^"
log	"   hint: add the bound that says a copy exists: `<T: ExplicitCopy>` for the whole duplicable family, or `<T: Copy>` for the silent tier. Without one, `.copy()` here would be a real copy for some instantiations and a double free for others"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
